Prove session acceptance and removed-key refusal on two deployed hosts

Usage: wamn-gates host-session-proof [OPTIONS] --issuer <ISSUER> --ca-file <CA_FILE> --fixture-file <FIXTURE_FILE> --endpoints <ENDPOINTS> --jwks-available <JWKS_AVAILABLE>

Options:
      --issuer <ISSUER>
          [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_ISSUER]
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>
          Log level (the Jobs pass this before the subcommand) [default: info]
      --ca-file <CA_FILE>
          [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_CA_FILE=]
      --fixture-file <FIXTURE_FILE>
          [env: WAMN_HOST_SESSION_FIXTURE_FILE=]
      --endpoints <ENDPOINTS>
          [env: WAMN_HOST_SESSION_ENDPOINTS]
      --jwks-available <JWKS_AVAILABLE>
          [env: WAMN_HOST_SESSION_JWKS_AVAILABLE=] [possible values: true, false]
  -h, --help
          Print help
